# Gameplay & Features
- Added a new Settings menu and Shop.
- Added a Death Screen.
- Added a new currency: **Scraps**.
- Added proper kill verification.
- Added Last Attacker tracking, which awards kills and displays information on the Death Screen.
- Characters now play hurt sounds.
- Changed the scream sound.
- Characters now respawn when they get far enough away, to prevent Cheaters and Bugs from occuring.
- Added Music to Playlist: [Positively Dark - Awakening](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWmAxDSJ3qA)

# UI & Controls
- Revamped the Menu.
- You can now pause and change your settings, customize your Bobbler, or browse the shop while in-game.
- The pause menu does NOT make you invincible or prevent NPCs from attacking you.
- Added a proper Loading Screen.
- Fixed Console and Mobile controls.
- Fixed the Return To Menu prompt appearing while already in the menu.
- If a controller is connected to your computer, you may need to press a key on your preferred input device to prioritize its inputs.
- You can now look up/down if you are at the limits of your arms
- You can retract your arms by using the scroll wheel, Scrolling up extends them

# NPCs & Combat
- Improved NPC AI.
- Attempted to fix NPCs exploding during combat. Please report it if this still happens!
- Improved health detection.
- NPCs can now grab items.
- NPCs now wander around when nobody is nearby to fight.

# Visuals & Effects
- Updated the map with help from @radiancecascades or Mat in [Soggy World](https://soggy.world/)
- Updated materials and slightly adjusted lighting.
- Characters now use Leather as their body material.
- Blood effects now use a pooling system.

# Anti-Cheat
- Improved anti-cheat detection.
- In certain cases, when a player is flagged by the anti-cheat, a server-wide message will announce their ban.
- Dex Explorer is now detected.
- Infinite Yield should now be detected.

# Technical Changes
- Rescripted the server, but it still functions the same.
- Rescripted the client, but it still functions the same.

# Gamepass Changes
- Removed the Hats and Faces gamepasses in favor of the new Scraps currency and Shop system.
- Unfortunately Roblox does not provide a way for us to refund these purchases, so existing purchases will not be refunded.

# Known Issues
Please Read Through here before making a bug report.
- Sometimes your character deletes itself randomly, Fix:
  Open the Pause Menu (Key P or Topbar) & press Play / Resume, If that doesn't work Rejoin.
- NPCs Get Hurt by their own item when swinging them, This is intentional.

